flowchart LR
    IN([from phase 1]) --> P4[Normalize: dates, VAT, SAR conversion, credit notes]
    P4 --> P5[Reconcile invoices to bank deposits]
    P5 --> P6[Risk checks: duplicates, activity gaps, entity match, related parties]
    P6 --> P7{Any open flags?}
    P7 -- Yes --> O2{Ops: resolve or request documents?}
    O2 -- Request documents --> S4[SME: fix and re-upload]
    O2 -- Resolve with note --> P8[Generate package and bank summary]
    P7 -- No --> P8
    S4 --> BACK([back to phase 1 coverage check])
    classDef sme fill:#FDF2E9,stroke:#C0702A,color:#000
    classDef plat fill:#EAF2FB,stroke:#2E6DB4,color:#000
    classDef ops fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#3C8D40,color:#000
    classDef bank fill:#F3EEFA,stroke:#6B47A8,color:#000
    class S4 sme
    class IN,P4,P5,P6,P7,P8,BACK plat
    class O2 ops
